 ```
 
+You do not need to revert `environmentdImageRef` as part of cancelling. The
+Operator keeps the `balancerd` and `console` components aligned with the
+environmentd image of the last completed rollout (recorded in
+`status.lastCompletedRolloutEnvironmentdImageRef`), rather than the image in
+`spec.environmentdImageRef`. This means that if you cancel a rollout by
+reverting only `requestRollout` and leave `environmentdImageRef` pointing at
+the newer version, `balancerd` and `console` continue to run the version that
+matches the currently running environmentd instead of the newer spec image.
+
